o get them to _at least launch_ (with a black screen) is by running the following .bat command in the Godot / game directory:\n\n`start \"\" \".\\Godot_v4.5-beta5_windows_arm64.exe\" --rendering-method mobile --rendering-driver d3d12`\n\n[Here are the logs that Godot produces when launching w/ these compatibility settings](https://pastebin.com/EvH7rC9x)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI'm not exactly sure how to reproduce this, but I guess you could try running Godot in a VM running Windows 11 ARM64. Though, I'm not sure if it's simply an issue with my computer in specific.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI can't launch Godot so I can't provide this unfortunately","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109833/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109833/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}